== '''Reactor Startup - Access''' ==
[[File:Sector B - U-Junction.png|193x193px|From the experimental workspaces side.|alt=From the experimental workspaces side.|thumb]]
For new or returning players, the layout of the facility has been changed quite a bit. To even access the ECFR control room, make your way over to Sector C (cargo area), this will be indicated by the yellow hallways. To access this area, you must go over from Sector B's "U-Junction" and enter into the Sector C hallway. If you are on the coming from the experimental workspaces/employee area located in Sector B, the image is shown here with the arrow pointing to the door. It is recommended to have a speed coil as it reduces the time it takes to reach Sector D, where the reactor is located.                
