== '''Reactor Startup - Activation''' ==
This sub-part will go over the steps required to activate the reactor core. There has been a new addition to the ECFR, that being the safeguards. These were added in the initial Part 2 update in December of last year.

=== '''Startup Preparation''' ===
Once you reach the Sector D entrance, cycle the airlock through (given it already isn't open on your side) and you will have access to Sector D, and by extension, the Reactor Control Room. [[File:Sector D - Airlock.png|thumb|471x471px|Sector D.|center]]
